        exp: "The error lies in the segment \"has submitted their report\". \"Committee\" is a collective noun acting as a single unit here, which is evident from the use of the singular verb 'has'. Therefore, the singular possessive pronoun 'its' should be used instead of the plural 'their'. The correct phrasing is \"has submitted its report\"."
