        correct: 0,
        exp: "The word \"Noxious\" means harmful, poisonous, or very unpleasant. Therefore, its direct antonym is \"Beneficial\", which means resulting in good, favorable, or advantageous outcomes. \"Toxic\" and \"Poisonous\" are synonyms of noxious."
