        text: "Q17. Choose the correct one-word substitute for:\n<div style=\"background:#f5f5f5; padding:10px; font-style:italic; border-left:4px solid #FF5722; margin:15px 0;\">\nA person who collects or studies butterflies\n</div>\nChoose the correct option: [SSC CHSL Tier 1, 12 Nov 2025, Shift-2]",
