        text: "Q21. Choose the most suitable option to replace the highlighted part of the sentence:",
        options: ["My brother works for a MNC. [SSC CHSL Tier 1, 12 Nov 2025, Shift-2]","MNC","an MNC","wherever MNC","any MNC"],
