        exp: "A's 1 day's work = $\\frac{1}{30}$. In 6 days, work completed = $6 \\times \\frac{1}{30} = \\frac{6}{30} = \\frac{1}{5}$. / A का 1 दिन का कार्य = $\\frac{1}{30}$। 6 दिनों में, पूरा किया गया कार्य = $6 \\times \\frac{1}{30} = \\frac{6}{30} = \\frac{1}{5}$।"
